Lead – Strongly Recommend

Demonstrates strong strategic thinking and a clear ability to lead and empower others. When the TM project lead left the bank, they stepped in and took ownership, ensuring continuity while giving the team the support and confidence to deliver. I particularly value their ability to balance delivery with mentoring and developing others, demonstrating strong leadership at VP level.

Values & Mindset – Strongly Recommend

Consistently demonstrates integrity and a commitment to doing the right thing. They approach challenges with a positive and pragmatic mindset, take accountability and genuinely care about the people they work with. Their willingness to step up when needed, while continuing to empower and support the team, reflects the values and behaviours I expect from a strong VP.

Overall, I would strongly recommend them.
